 been called and the bells being rung—_ Christopher Back Kim, they will be bringing in helicopters tonight to start taking people off the offshore oil rigs. Do you people understand that? Senator Kim Carr interjecting— Stephen Parry Order! Senator Back and Senator Carr! Senator Back interjecting— Order, Senator Back! Senator Lines interjecting— Senator Lines, that applies to you too. Glenn Sterle It's a shame you lot don't have the same level of passion about truckies! Stephen Parry Senator Sterle! Senator Heffernan interjecting— Senator Heffernan! Senators, it is disorderly to interject, let alone when you are not in your own seats, so there should be silence. The Senate divided. [18:54] (The President—Senator Parry)","result":"affirmative","slug":"division-federal-senate-3372","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2014-07-16/2"}
